{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Independent integrals of motion — gl(4) XXX chain, L = 2 and L = 3, rectangular sites\n\n**Question.** At `L = 2` with sites `[S,S,0,0] x [P,P,0,0]`, the twisted transfer matrices carry 8 independent integrals of motion (5 free coefficients + 3 weights), but at zero twist only **2** remain (`ΔC_2` and one more; see `SU4_SoV_Orthogonality_Untwisted_L2.wb`). How many remain at `L = 3`?\n\n**Method.** Build the transfer matrices explicitly: GT-pattern Lax operators `L_{ij}(u) = u δ_{ij} - h E_{ji}`, monodromy `T = L^{(1)}(u-θ_1) \\cdots L^{(L)}(u-θ_L)`, twist `z_i T_{ij}`, quantum minors, `τ_a(u) = Σ_{|I|=a}` principal minors. The integrals of motion are the `u`-coefficients of `τ_1, τ_2, τ_3` (`τ_4` is the central quantum determinant). Their number, **modulo the identity**, is\n\n$$\\#\\mathrm{IoM} = \\dim\\mathrm{span}\\{\\mathbb 1,\\ \\tau_a(u_k)\\ :\\ a=1,2,3;\\ k=1..aL+1\\} - 1 ,$$\n\nsampling each `τ_a` (degree `aL`) at `aL+1` points. Because the `τ_a` commute and are diagonalisable, this span is detected faithfully by acting on **one generic vector** `v`: `τ ↦ τ v` is injective on it. So only matrix-vector products are needed, and the rank is exact (rational arithmetic).\n\n**Caveat.** The count cannot exceed (number of distinct joint eigenvalues) − 1, so for small spins it can be capped. We increase the spins until it stabilises.\n\nParameters: `θ = (1/3, 1/7, 2/5)`, `h = 1`, twist `z = (2, 3, 1/2, 1/5)` or `z = 1`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. gl(4) GT-basis generators (verbatim from SU4_untwisted.wb, cell 1) ---- *)\nClearAll[ps, dim, J0, Jp, Jm, JJ, v];\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\n\"1. GT generators loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"46\" data-out-n=\"328\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[328]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MS4gR1QgZ2VuZXJhdG9ycyBsb2FkZWR9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1. GT generators loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[328]= \\text{1. GT generators loaded}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a233caa9-4ada-49d2-9e6b-4bc5041930e9"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. Lax operator, monodromy for any number of sites, twisted quantum minors and transfer matrices,\n   all as SPARSE numeric matrices at a given (rational) u. sites = {{lambda_1, theta_1}, ..., {lambda_L, theta_L}}.\n   Same conventions as SU4_untwisted.wb: L_ij(u) = u delta_ij - h E_ji, T = L1 L2 ... (auxiliary index contracted\n   left to right), twist z_i T_ij, minor = Sum_sigma sgn(sigma) T[I_sigma(1), I_1](u) T[I_sigma(2), I_2](u-h) ... ---- *)\nClearAll[hh, lax, Tmono, Tg, qminV, tauV];\nhh = 1;\nlax[λ_, u_] := lax[λ, u] = Table[SparseArray[u KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[dim[λ]] - hh JJ[j, i, λ]], {i, 4}, {j, 4}];\nTmono[sites_, u_] := Tmono[sites, u] = Fold[Function[{M, st}, With[{Lx = lax[st[[1]], u - st[[2]]]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[M[[i, k]], Lx[[k, j]]], {k, 4}], {i, 4}, {j, 4}]]], lax[sites[[1, 1]], u - sites[[1, 2]]], Rest[sites]];\nTg[sites_, zs_, u_][i_, j_] := zs[[i]] Tmono[sites, u][[i, j]];\n(* action of the principal quantum minor on I, and of tau_a, on a vector w *)\nqminV[sites_, zs_, II_List, u_, w_] := Sum[Module[{x = w}, Do[x = Tg[sites, zs, u - (k - 1) hh][II[[σ[[k]]]], II[[k]]] . x, {k, Length[II], 1, -1}]; Signature[σ] x], {σ, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\ntauV[sites_, zs_, a_, u_, w_] := Sum[qminV[sites, zs, I, u, w], {I, Subsets[Range[4], {a}]}];\n\"2. transfer matrices loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"47\" data-out-n=\"336\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[336]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7Mi4gdHJhbnNmZXIgbWF0cmljZXMgbG9hZGVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2. transfer matrices loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[336]= \\text{2. transfer matrices loaded}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "bc1df0e4-ccc7-4fd5-8398-d7f454e36890"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Sanity checks on the construction, L = 3, sites [1,1,0,0]^3, twisted and untwisted:\n   (a) [tau_a(u1), tau_b(u2)] = 0 on a random vector;  (b) tau_4 is proportional to the identity;\n   (c) tau_1 leading coefficient chi_1 = Sum z (checked at large u through tau_1(u) v / u^L -> chi_1 v). ---- *)\nClearAll[chkSites, chkZ];\nchkSites = {{{1, 1, 0, 0}, 1/3}, {{1, 1, 0, 0}, 1/7}, {{1, 1, 0, 0}, 2/5}};\nsanity[zs_] := Module[{d = Times @@ (dim /@ chkSites[[All, 1]]), w, t4},\n   SeedRandom[7]; w = RandomInteger[{-9, 9}, d];\n   t4 = tauV[chkSites, zs, 4, 5/3, w];\n   {\"dim\" -> d,\n    \"commute\" -> And @@ Flatten[Table[tauV[chkSites, zs, a, 2/9, tauV[chkSites, zs, b, 7/5, w]] == tauV[chkSites, zs, b, 7/5, tauV[chkSites, zs, a, 2/9, w]], {a, 3}, {b, a + 1, 3}]],\n    \"tau4 ~ identity\" -> (MatrixRank[{w, t4}] == 1)}];\nGrid[{{\"twisted z = (2,3,1/2,1/5)\", sanity[{2, 3, 1/2, 1/5}]}, {\"untwisted z = 1\", sanity[{1, 1, 1, 1}]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"51811\" data-output-id=\"84\" data-out-n=\"20\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[20]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.46em;vertical-align:-0.96em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.46em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.42em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.96em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.46em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twisted z = (2,3,1/2,1/5)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">untwisted z = 1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.96em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.42em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.96em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.46em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">216</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commute</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tau4 ~</span><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> identity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">216</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commute</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tau4 ~</span><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> identity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.96em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.42em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.96em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.92em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.96em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[20]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{twisted z = (2,3,1/2,1/5)} & \\left\\{\\text{dim}\\to 216,\\text{commute}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{tau4 \\textasciitilde{} identity}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{untwisted z = 1} & \\left\\{\\text{dim}\\to 216,\\text{commute}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{tau4 \\textasciitilde{} identity}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3f945a35-55f9-4de3-8070-abe14aaf40eb"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. The count. One generic vector w; sample tau_a at a L + 1 points; rank of {w, tau_a(u_k) w} minus 1.\n   Reported cumulatively: after tau_1, after tau_1..2, after tau_1..3; plus tau_4 as a check (must add nothing).\n   Two different random vectors must agree. ---- *)\nClearAll[countIoM];\ncountIoM[sites_, zs_, seed_] := Module[{L = Length[sites], d = Times @@ (dim /@ sites[[All, 1]]), w, blk, r},\n   SeedRandom[seed]; w = RandomInteger[{-9, 9}, d];\n   blk[a_] := Table[tauV[sites, zs, a, 1/11 + k, w], {k, 0, a L}];\n   r[as_] := MatrixRank[Join[{w}, Join @@ (blk /@ as)]] - 1;\n   {d, r[{1}], r[{1, 2}], r[{1, 2, 3}], r[{1, 2, 3, 4}]}];\nClearAll[countRow];\ncountRow[label_, sites_, zs_] := With[{c1 = countIoM[sites, zs, 1], c2 = countIoM[sites, zs, 2]}, {label, c1[[1]], c1[[2]], c1[[3]], c1[[4]], c1[[5]], c1 === c2}];\ncountHeader = {\"sites\", \"dim\", \"#IoM from τ1\", \"from τ1,τ2\", \"from τ1,τ2,τ3\", \"+ τ4 (check)\", \"2 seeds agree\"};\n\"4. counting loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"51811\" data-output-id=\"85\" data-out-n=\"26\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[26]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7NC4gY291bnRpbmcgbG9hZGVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">4. counting loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
