  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Benchmark: L = 2\n\nMust reproduce the orthogonality notebook: **8** twisted (5 free coefficients + 3 weights), **2** untwisted. At `(1,1)` and `(2,1)` the untwisted count is capped at 2 by the number of irreps (3), so `(2,2)` (6 irreps) is the real test.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 5. L = 2 benchmark ---- *)\nbench2 = With[{zt = {2, 3, 1/2, 1/5}, z1 = {1, 1, 1, 1}, s2 = Function[{a, b}, {{{a, a, 0, 0}, 1/3}, {{b, b, 0, 0}, 1/7}}]},\n   {countRow[\"(1,1) twisted\", s2[1, 1], zt], countRow[\"(2,2) twisted\", s2[2, 2], zt],\n    countRow[\"(1,1) z=1\", s2[1, 1], z1], countRow[\"(2,1) z=1\", s2[2, 1], z1], countRow[\"(2,2) z=1\", s2[2, 2], z1], countRow[\"(3,3) z=1\", s2[3, 3], z1]}];\nGrid[Prepend[bench2, countHeader], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
