      {
       "data": "Out[33]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{sites} & \\text{dim} & \\text{\\#IoM from $\\tau$1} & \\text{from $\\tau$1,$\\tau$2} & \\text{from $\\tau$1,$\\tau$2,$\\tau$3} & \\text{+ $\\tau$4 (check)} & \\text{2 seeds agree}\\\\\\hline\\text{(1,1,1,1) twisted} & 1296 & 4 & 12 & 16 & 16 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(1,1,1,1) z=1} & 1296 & 3 & 9 & 10 & 10 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(2,1,1,1) z=1} & 4320 & 3 & 9 & 10 & 10 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7533a775-6dac-4669-845c-92dec8a51ebf"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary over L = 2, 3, 4 (exact)\n\n| L | twisted (τ_1, +τ_2, +τ_3) | zero twist (τ_1, +τ_2, +τ_3) | lost |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 2 | 2, 6, **8** | 1, 2, **2** | 6 |\n| 3 | 3, 9, **12** | 2, 6, **6** | 6 |\n| 4 | 4, 12, **16** | 3, 9, **10** | 6 |\n\nThe L = 4 counts are at `[1,1,0,0]^4` (dim 1296), and the zero-twist count is unchanged at `[2,2,0,0]x[1,1,0,0]^3` (dim 4320).\n\n- **Twisted: `4L`** — 3 weights plus `4L - 3` free coefficients. `τ_1` contributes `L`, `τ_2` adds `2L`, `τ_3` adds `L`.\n- **Zero twist: `4L - 6`.** The number lost is **6 at every L tested**, matching the number of positive roots of gl(4).\n\nThe split of the loss between `τ_2` and `τ_3` depends on the order in which the transfer matrices are added, so only the totals are meaningful. The `4L - 6` law is observed at three lengths, not derived.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
 ],
